  "wikipediaSummary": {
    "title": "Curtis (Curtis Mayfield album)",
    "description": "1970 studio album by Curtis Mayfield",
    "extract": "Curtis is the debut studio album by American soul musician Curtis Mayfield, released in September 1970. Produced by Mayfield, it was released on his own label Curtom Records. The musical styles of Curtis moved further away from the pop-soul sounds of Mayfield's previous group The Impressions and featured more of a funk and psychedelic-influenced sound. The album's subject matter incorporates political and social concerns of the time.",
